@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Future after MVP. Provider, advanced Sprint/review, or untrusted execution requirement retained as deferred.
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam ArrowColor #526B7B
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #DFF1EF
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam sequenceActorBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #9AAEB7
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #7B919E
skinparam sequenceDividerBackgroundColor #EDF4FB
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF3DF
skinparam noteBorderColor #B99557
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
hide footbox
autonumber
title AFTER MVP — SB-M13 — Gated run admission and attributable actual attempts
actor "Authorized actor / trigger context" as U
participant "Workflow definition" as D
participant "Workflow run" as R
participant "Execution attempt" as A
participant "Restricted output" as O
U -> D : Request supported work for intended code / definition
D -> D : Validate contract, trigger and current authority
alt Unsupported or denied
 D --> U : Rejected; no execution
else Supported request
 D -> R : Evaluate enabling / isolation / resource / secret conditions
 alt Required enabling evidence or authority missing
  R --> U : Blocked / disabled; no execution claim
 else Future eligible execution context
  R -> R : Identify effective code / definition and initiator
  R -> A : Start permitted bounded attempt
  alt Actual execution result confirmed
   A -> O : Identify actual logs / artifacts and availability
   O --> U : Restricted attributable outputs and actual result
  else Runner lost, limit exceeded or result unknown
   A --> R : Actual failed / cancelled / unknown condition
   R --> U : Explicit outcome; reconcile before consequential retry
  end
 end
end
note over D,O
Validation alone does not satisfy real execution capability.
A retry needs distinct attempt context; no deployment approval is inherited.
end note
legend bottom
Logical domain interaction, not runtime execution evidence.
Detailed proposed guards/policies retain their primary status.
endlegend
@enduml
